DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmffiiii driver provides support for the MegaRAID SAS Fusion family of
     RAID controllers using the following chipsets:

           --   SAS2208
           --   SAS3008
           --   SAS3108
           --   SAS3404
           --   SAS3408
           --   SAS3416
           --   SAS3504
           --   SAS3508
           --   SAS3516
           --   SAS3816
           --   SAS3916

     These controllers support RAID 0, RAID 1, RAID 5, RAID 6, RAID 10, RAID
     50 and RAID 60 using either SAS or SATA II drives.

     Although the controllers are actual RAID controllers, they appear as SCSI
     controllers.  All RAID configuration is done through the controllers'
     BIOSes.

